add(69,'conjecture','161-5',[24,28,29],'1202,1454-1498','A-t-on unicité ... à isom unique près?','Is such tensor extension unique relative to its fixed restriction and comparison data? The later group-action conjugacy problem is a possible mechanism, not a proof.','Comparison with restriction in H¹ is a reconstruction contingent on Γ and coefficient definitions.','agrees','Existence and uniqueness are separate interrogative clauses.')
