add(71,'idea of the earlier run','161-5',[27],'1407-1415','G″_L≃G′_L non canonique','If G″=Aut_G(Q), U⊂G″, and R is a trivial U-torsor, a section gives P=R×^UQ≃Q and Aut_G(P)≃G″; no trivialization of Q is required.','Conditional torsor calculation, sensitive to the prime labels.','agrees','Both witnesses give a comparison between two primed groups, not necessarily the original G.')
